@startuml review_sequence
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceFontSize 13

actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "MatchController" as MC
participant "MatchService" as MS
participant "MatchState\n(FinishedState)" as FS
participant "ReportService" as RS
participant "ReviewReportAgent" as RRA
participant "DataCollectAgent" as DCA
participant "RemoteModelAgent" as RMA
participant "ChatClient\n(Spring AI)" as CC
participant "DeepSeek API" as DS
participant "LocalRuleAgent" as LRA
participant "MatchReportService" as MRS
participant "MatchReportMapper" as MRM

Admin -> MC: POST /api/matches/{id}/finish\n(结束比赛)
MC -> MS: finishMatch(matchId)

MS -> MS: loadMatch(matchId)
MS -> FS: finish(match)
FS -> FS: setStatus(FINISHED)
FS --> MS: Result.ok("比赛已结束")

MS -> RS: generateReport(matchId)
RS -> RRA: execute(match)

RRA -> DCA: collect(match)
DCA -> DCA: rebuildPlayerStatsFromEvents()
DCA -> DCA: 拼接结构化数据
DCA --> RRA: 返回数据摘要

RRA -> RMA: callWithPrompt(match, REVIEW_REPORT,\nsystemPrompt, userPrompt)
RMA -> CC: prompt().system().user().call().content()
CC -> DS: HTTP POST 同步请求
DS --> CC: AI 生成的复盘报告
CC --> RMA: 返回文本内容

alt 远程AI调用成功
    RMA --> RRA: AiAgentResponse(success, content)
    RRA --> RS: 返回AI生成的复盘报告
else 远程AI调用失败 (重试后仍失败)
    RMA --> RRA: AiAgentResponse(failure, errorMsg)
    RRA -> LRA: execute(match)
    LRA -> LRA: generateReview(match)\n本地规则模板生成
    LRA --> RRA: 返回模板复盘报告
    RRA --> RS: 返回本地规则报告
end

RS -> MRS: saveOrUpdate(matchId, reportType, content)
MRS -> MRM: insert/update 报告记录
MRM --> MRS: 保存成功
MRS --> RS: 保存完成

RS --> MC: 报告生成完毕
MC --> Admin: 展示赛后复盘报告
@enduml
